[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments/3592589291","pull_request_review_id":4710397979,"id":3592589291,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOO5D6p87WIo_r","diff_hunk":"@@ -9,6 +9,7 @@ Type=simple\n User=root\n Group=root\n ExecStart=/usr/local/sbin/cie-runner-bootstrap\n+WorkingDirectory=/opt/actions-runner","path":"scripts/infra/windows-hyperv-runner/golden-image/cie-runner-bootstrap.service","commit_id":"6a26f2930a46e3a3a45727ec470b999b48cbd23d","original_commit_id":"6a26f2930a46e3a3a45727ec470b999b48cbd23d","user":{"login":"gemini-code-assist[bot]","id":176961590,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCow4Ng","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/956858?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gemini-code-assist%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/gemini-code-assist","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gemini-code-assist%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gemini-code-assist%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gemini-code-assist%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gemini-code-assist%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gemini-code-assist%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gemini-code-assist%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gemini-code-assist%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gemini-code-assist%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gemini-code-assist%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"![critical](https://www.gstatic.com/codereviewagent/critical.svg)\n\nWith `ProtectSystem=strict` enabled, the entire filesystem is mounted read-only for the service except for paths explicitly allowed in `ReadWritePaths`. Since `WorkingDirectory` is set to `/opt/actions-runner`, the Actions Runner (`Runner.Listener`) will attempt to write its configuration and credential files (such as `.runner`, `.credentials`, and `.credentials_rsaparams`) directly into `/opt/actions-runner` during initialization.\n\nBecause `/opt/actions-runner` itself is not in the `ReadWritePaths` list (only its subdirectories `_diag` and `_work` are), these write operations will fail with a 'Read-only file system' error, causing the runner to exit immediately before establishing a network connection. This explains why the second pilot's listener exited before establishing a network connection.\n\nTo resolve this, add `/opt/actions-runner` to `ReadWritePaths`. Since systemd allows multiple `ReadWritePaths` directives, we can append it directly under `WorkingDirectory`.\n\n```\nWorkingDirectory=/opt/actions-runner\nReadWritePaths=/opt/actions-runner\n```","created_at":"2026-07-16T04:12:23Z","updated_at":"2026-07-16T04:12:23Z","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1584#discussion_r3592589291","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1584","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments/3592589291"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1584#discussion_r3592589291"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1584"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments/3592589291/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":12,"original_line":12,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"NONE","original_position":4,"position":4,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments/3592606686","pull_request_review_id":4710416146,"id":3592606686,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOO5D6p87WItPe","diff_hunk":"@@ -9,6 +9,7 @@ Type=simple\n User=root\n Group=root\n ExecStart=/usr/local/sbin/cie-runner-bootstrap\n+WorkingDirectory=/opt/actions-runner","path":"scripts/infra/windows-hyperv-runner/golden-image/cie-runner-bootstrap.service","commit_id":"6a26f2930a46e3a3a45727ec470b999b48cbd23d","original_commit_id":"6a26f2930a46e3a3a45727ec470b999b48cbd23d","user":{"login":"chatgpt-codex-connector[bot]","id":199175422,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOC98s_g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1144995?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chatgpt-codex-connector%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/chatgpt-codex-connector","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chatgpt-codex-connector%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chatgpt-codex-connector%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chatgpt-codex-connector%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chatgpt-codex-connector%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chatgpt-codex-connector%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chatgpt-codex-connector%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chatgpt-codex-connector%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chatgpt-codex-connector%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chatgpt-codex-connector%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"**<sub><sub>![P1 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P1-orange?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Make the JIT config files writable**\n\nThis still leaves the JIT startup path unable to create its runner config: the pinned [actions/runner v2.335.1 JIT branch](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/actions/runner/v2.335.1/src/Runner.Listener/Runner.cs) decodes `--jitconfig` and writes files such as `.runner`, `.credentials`, and `.credentials_rsaparams` under the runner root before it loads settings or connects to GitHub. With `ProtectSystem=strict` and `ReadWritePaths` limited to `_diag`, `_work`, `/home/gha-runner`, and `/run/cie-jit`, `/opt/actions-runner` itself is still read-only, so the next pilot will fail closed before any GitHub TCP session. Please grant write access for the root config files or stage them through a writable path before invoking `Runner.Listener`.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.","created_at":"2026-07-16T04:17:24Z","updated_at":"2026-07-16T04:17:24Z","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1584#discussion_r3592606686","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1584","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments/3592606686"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1584#discussion_r3592606686"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1584"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments/3592606686/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":12,"original_line":12,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"NONE","original_position":4,"position":4,"subject_type":"line"}]